70bffed94e57f873a125","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ez.1/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-10-31T13:47:46.856699","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ez.1","local_name":"bob-cli-ez.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-ez","agent_clan_generation":"20261031133339","bead_id":"bob-cli-ez.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ez[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Keep → Inbox footer indicator[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian's desktop status bar shows, beside the review footer, a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]gold bulb pill counting the Google Keep notes a default `bob gkeep [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]pull` would act on (only once Keep has verifiably worked on this [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]host) and a plain inbox-tray count of open top-level tasks in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]gkeep_inbox.md. bob owns the Keep count, its cache, and its check [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]budget; the footer is a calm, attention-gated client.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gkeep_footer_indicator.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/gkeep_footer_indicator.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ez[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ez/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Keep adapter hardening[/bold #D7AFFF]                                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keep-adapter-hardening[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-adapter-hardening: bound gkeepapi's endless 429 retry, classify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rate-limit 403s as rate_limit, stop network blips from forcing a full [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resync, and drop the redundant state save in the Python adapter, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]self-tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host-local Keep status cache and its writers[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]keep-status-cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-status-cache: add the 0600 status.json cache under bob's state dir [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a default-pull observation helper, and make list, pull (dry and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real), doctor, and login record observations, failures, and pull [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]invalidation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob gkeep status with bob-owned check gates[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]keep-status-command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keep-adapter-hardening, keep-status-cache[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-status-command: add `bob gkeep status [-b] [-f] [-m] [-r]`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never-prompting token read, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness/floor/single-flight/busy/budget/backoff gates, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gkeep.check_interval, the JSON and human output, the catalog row and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gkeep invalidation tag, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Command Mode preview API[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]command-mode-preview-api[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]command-mode-preview-api: add `api.commandMode.preview(argv)` to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-command-mode so a sibling plugin can open the sheet straight into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row's preview stage, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ledger-tools Keep inbox status-bar item[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]keep-indicator-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keep-status-command[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-indicator-view: add the bob-keep-inbox status-bar item to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-ledger-tools with a pure view model, the live Tasks-cache inbox [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]count, cache-only Keep reads, the full visual design, the inbox click, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Attention-gated Keep checks and indicator actions[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]keep-indicator-actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after command-mode-preview-api, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]keep-indicator-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-indicator-actions: add attention-gated `bob gkeep status -r` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]triggers, Check now, the bulb click into a previewed pull, the context [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu and commands, the sign-in notice, docs, and the optional decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ez","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ez.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5cdcc96df21e512644e5052e3655e002","started_at":"2026-10-31T13:34:25.562268","state":"dismissed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"8d2cf8874f862985b5749c9305acb3377e1833383bac98f7f61528ceaac054c8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apo